OL,3,GNEWSAAim to end two-year NHS waits in
OL,4,AWales by May 2027, first minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRhun ap Iorwerth is facing opposition
OL,7,Fleaders and Senedd members at First
OL,8,FMinister's Questions
OL,10,FIt is the first one for Reform's new
OL,11,FWelsh leader Helen Jenner since she was
OL,12,Fgiven the top job on Monday, following
OL,13,FDan Thomas's resignation
OL,15,FJenner accuses ap Iorwerth of letting
OL,16,Fdown grooming gang victims by not
OL,17,Flaunching a Wales-specific inquiry into
OL,18,Fthem
