OL,3,GNEWSAAim to end two-year NHS waits in
OL,4,AWales by May 2027, first minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister says "we have issues
OL,7,Fhere that we need to get to grips with"
OL,8,Fin order to safeguard people at risk of
OL,9,Fthe gangs
OL,11,FAp Iorwerth also clarifies that his
OL,12,Fpledge to end two-year NHS waits is for
OL,13,Fthat to happen by May 2027
OL,15,FYou can watch FMQs live by clicking
OL,16,Fplay at the top of the page from 13:30
